  "root_static_scope": "Root actually viewed all seven current Longhua captures separately. Near/oblique show physical tile eaves, galleries and openings; distant view shows complete small tower silhouette. Full detail returns after LOD/owner release and manifest reset. Exact old target component removal and 13 local neighbors are bound by actual browser state checks.",
  "root_static_limitations": [
    "Near/oblique views crop the upper tower; full silhouette is additionally reviewed in the actual native render and distant view.",
    "The release/away image intentionally has no tower; the distant silhouette is too small to validate facade detail.",
    "Surrounding city buildings retain their prior generic detailed baseline; this release does not provide all16district photo-level facades.",
    "Nominal overall height is official-source based; widths/taper/hidden faces/support sizes and first-level absolute door phase remain estimated. No surveyed interior or photogrammetry claim.",
    "Software rendering and deliberate Overture outage validate functionality only, not hardware frame rate. Non-target navigation cancellation warnings are separately retained in the technical report."
  ],
  "root_catalog_scope": "Root actually viewed all five actual catalog images separately. Static adoption and return preserve the same detailed tower. Dynamic-only loading and return also show the same geometry after real unload/reload, with all13 neighbors retained. The intentionally corrupt index rejects the new model and retains the complete14-owner original baseline, visibly without a site hole.",
  "root_catalog_limitations": [
    "Fifth image intentionally shows the old generic octagonal building under a one-byte corrupt-index test; it is failure-recovery evidence, not detailed Longhua appearance.",
    "Dynamic-only test removes this one curated record and static replacement; production retains25 navigation records.",
    "Near images crop the upper tower. Full silhouette and model detail have separate native/static proofs.",
    "Source-based exterior with nominal official height and documented estimated hidden geometry/door compass phase, not a survey or validated interior.",
    "Software-rendered functional checks of one macro; no user-device FPS or all16district photographic completion claim. Surrounding generic baseline is retained."
  ]
